tly 60 captions, no extra text, and it *must* be valid JSON. I'll make sure the array is well-formed, using double quotes, not single quotes, and no comments. I'll go through and ensure each interval is 1 second. The prompt made this pretty simple.\n\nSo, I start with the first 60 seconds (00:00:00.000 to 00:01:00.000). I analyze the video.\n\nI went through the content and made the captions, then double checked them. Finally, time to format into a JSON array, making sure the interval is 1 second.\n\nI'm ready.\n\n\n"}